                <pb facs="1109" n="959" sameAs="frus:frus1907p2/pg959"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Bryan to the Minister for Foreign
                        Affairs.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Lisbon</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1907-01-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">January 18,
                    1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Excellency</hi>: Herewith I have the honor to
                    transmit a brief statement gathered from the report of the American consul at
                    Funchal, Madeira, concerning the arrest and detention of an American citizen
                    named Francisco F. Freitas, and I earnestly solict your excellency’s kind
                    attention in this matter and such treatment for this citizen of my country as he
                    is entitled to.</p>
                <p>I avail, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Charles Page
                    Bryan</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
